{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEC","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"撒迦利亞書","commonName":"撒迦利亞書","title":"撒迦利亞書","order":38,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"43ae9327f3a9401b8ec950d5d27f64f048bbd7ac8d6d42e14967d229e27fd011","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":211},"chapter":{"number":9,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["審判鄰國"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"以下是耶和華的啟示：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世人與以色列各支派的眼目都仰望耶和華。","poem":1},{"noteId":7},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的懲罰必臨到哈得拉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"臨到大馬士革，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以及與大馬士革比鄰的哈馬。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"極其聰明的泰爾和西頓也無法逃脫。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"泰爾為自己建造堡壘，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"堆積的銀子多如塵土，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"金子多如街上的泥土。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而，看啊，主必奪去她的一切，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摧毀她海上的權勢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她必被火吞噬。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"亞實基倫見狀必陷入恐懼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"迦薩見狀必充滿痛苦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以革倫也一樣，因為她希望破滅。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"迦薩必失去君王，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亞實基倫必荒無人煙。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"混雜的種族必佔領亞實突，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我","poem":1},{"noteId":8},{"text":"必剷除非利士人的驕傲。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必除去他們口中帶血的肉和齒間的可憎之物。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"餘下的人必歸屬我","poem":1},{"noteId":9},{"text":"，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"成為猶大的一族，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以革倫人必像耶布斯人一樣歸屬我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必在我家四周安營，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不容敵人入侵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再也不容外人來欺壓我的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為現在我親自看顧他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["要來的君王"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"少女錫安啊，要充滿喜樂！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"少女耶路撒冷啊，要歡呼！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，你的王到你這裡來了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂是公義、得勝的王，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"謙卑地騎著驢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"騎著一頭驢駒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必剷除以法蓮的戰車，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"剷除耶路撒冷的戰馬，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"戰弓必被折斷。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必向列國宣告和平，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必統治四海之疆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從幼發拉底河直到地極。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"錫安啊，因為我用血跟你立了約，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必將你中間被擄的人從無水之坑釋放出來。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有盼望的被擄者啊，回到你們的堡壘吧。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"今日我宣佈，我必加倍地補償你們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必把猶大當弓拉開，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把以法蓮當箭搭上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使錫安的眾子如勇士之劍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"去攻打希臘的眾子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"耶和華必在他們上面顯現，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的箭如閃電射出。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主耶和華必吹響號角，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"乘南方的暴風而來。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬軍之耶和華必保護他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必用彈石消滅、征服敵人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"飲血吶喊，猶如醉酒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像獻祭用的碗盛滿了血，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又像祭壇的四角淌滿了血。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到那天，他們的上帝耶和華必拯救他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"視他們為一群祂的子民。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必如王冠上的寶石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"閃耀在祂的土地上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那將是何等的奇妙，何等的美好！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"五穀必滋養少男，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"新酒必滋養少女。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":7,"caller":"+","text":"「世人與以色列各支派的眼目都仰望耶和華」或譯「耶和華鑒察以色列各支派，也鑒察所有的世人」。","reference":{"chapter":9,"verse":1}},{"noteId":8,"caller":"+","text":"「我」指耶和華，下同。","reference":{"chapter":9,"verse":6}},{"noteId":9,"caller":"+","text":"「我」希伯來文作「我們的上帝」。","reference":{"chapter":9,"verse":7}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/9.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/10.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/8.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}